       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. armstrong-numbers.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       REPOSITORY. FUNCTION ALL INTRINSIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUMBER PIC X(8).
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 9.
       01 WS-IDX    PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-NUM-CONV PIC 9(2).
       01 WS-RAISE    PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-HOLD-TOT PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-COUNT    PIC 9(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       ARMSTRONG-NUMBERS.
          MOVE 0 TO WS-HOLD-TOT
          MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NUMBER)) TO WS-COUNT
          PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 
          FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NUMBER))
            MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NUMBER(WS-IDX:1)) TO WS-NUM-CONV
            COMPUTE WS-RAISE = WS-NUM-CONV ** WS-COUNT
            COMPUTE WS-HOLD-TOT = WS-RAISE + WS-HOLD-TOT
          END-PERFORM.
            IF WS-HOLD-TOT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-NUMBER)
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
            ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-RESULT
            END-IF.